{9000}{Sold him to the Fine Pet Emporium down the road. After I dismissed Shareyko, Apollo developed very particular views about wagon axles. Fine horse. Terrible employee. The proprietor can arrange his sale.}{Sold him to the Fine Pet Emporium down the road. After I dismissed Shareyko, Apollo developed very particular views about wagon axles. Fine horse. Terrible employee. The proprietor can arrange his sale.}{}{}{0}{ }
{9001}{I will ask the pet emporium proprietor.}{}{1}{}{9010}{}
{9002}{Shareyko trained him well, then.}{}{1}{}{9020}{ }
{9003}{Not now.}{}{1}{}{1}{ }
{9010}{You will find Apollo by the other pets. Kindly do not mention that the horse was right about the axle.}{You will find Apollo by the other pets. Kindly do not mention that the horse was right about the axle.}{}{}{0}{ }
{9011}{Thank you.}{}{1}{}{0}{ }
{9020}{I employed one repairman. Somehow I ended up with two inspectors and neither would leave before breakfast.}{I employed one repairman. Somehow I ended up with two inspectors and neither would leave before breakfast.}{}{}{0}{ }
{9021}{All right.}{}{1}{}{1}{ }
{9030}{Apollo is yours now. The Fine Pet Emporium handles his arrangements. If he loses track of you, speak to the proprietor there. I do not miss the inspections. I do miss the horse.}{Apollo is yours now. The Fine Pet Emporium handles his arrangements. If he loses track of you, speak to the proprietor there. I do not miss the inspections. I do miss the horse.}{}{}{0}{ }
{9031}{I will speak to the proprietor.}{}{1}{gf2998 1}{0}{}
{9032}{Never mind.}{}{1}{}{1}{ }
{7}{Tell me about the goblin outside.}{}{1}{}{9100}{ }
{9100}{Shareyko. He was my caravan repairman, and the best in all Arcanum if you ask him. I have yet to find a better one. He fits beneath a carriage with room to work where the rest of us would be flat in the mud. He tended Apollo for many moons as well.}{Shareyko. He was my caravan repairman, and the best in all Arcanum if you ask him. I have yet to find a better one. He fits beneath a carriage with room to work where the rest of us would be flat in the mud. He tended Apollo for many moons as well.}{}{}{0}{ }
{9101}{Why is he no longer working for you?}{}{5}{}{9110}{ }
{9102}{Why fire him?}{}{-4}{}{9110}{ }
{9103}{Would you recommend him?}{}{5}{}{9120}{ }
{9104}{He good?}{}{-4}{}{9120}{ }
{9105}{I had another question.}{}{5}{}{1}{ }
{9106}{Other question.}{}{-4}{}{1}{ }
{9110}{His temper. We disagreed over a wagon, and he let the whole yard hear his opinion of me. I dismissed him. His work was never the problem. The outstanding balance on his tools is between him and Pritch.}{His temper. We disagreed over a wagon, and he let the whole yard hear his opinion of me. I dismissed him. His work was never the problem. The outstanding balance on his tools is between him and Pritch.}{}{}{0}{ }
{9111}{Was the wagon sound?}{}{5}{}{9130}{ }
{9112}{Wagon good?}{}{-4}{}{9130}{ }
{9113}{Would you recommend him?}{}{5}{}{9120}{ }
{9114}{He good?}{}{-4}{}{9120}{ }
{9115}{I see.}{}{5}{}{1}{ }
{9116}{I see.}{}{-4}{}{1}{ }
{9120}{For his workmanship, certainly. He finds wear in the undercarriage before it becomes a broken axle on the road. Give him clear terms, hear him out when he says something is unsafe, and you will have a useful man at your side. Just do not expect him to flatter you.}{For his workmanship, certainly. He finds wear in the undercarriage before it becomes a broken axle on the road. Give him clear terms, hear him out when he says something is unsafe, and you will have a useful man at your side. Just do not expect him to flatter you.}{}{}{0}{ }
{9121}{I will speak with him.}{}{5}{}{1}{ }
{9122}{I talk him.}{}{-4}{}{1}{ }
{9130}{The axle needed replacing. I had it replaced. That does not mean I needed his opinion delivered quite so loudly.}{The axle needed replacing. I had it replaced. That does not mean I needed his opinion delivered quite so loudly.}{}{}{0}{ }
{9131}{Understood.}{}{5}{}{1}{ }
{9132}{All right.}{}{-4}{}{1}{ }
